{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1521","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"《易传·文言》： 《周易》有“经”和“传”两部分。“传”是对“经”的解说，有七种文辞共十篇，称“十翼”。《文言》是“十翼”之一。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10195-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"道恶（wū）乎隐而有真伪：大道隐藏于哪里，才（使原本浑朴的世间）有了真伪之分？恶乎，在哪里。乎，相当于“于”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10195-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"因也者，无益无损也。……因也者，舍己而以物为法者也：所谓顺应，就是不增不减（有所增减，则是有为）。……所谓顺应，就是舍弃自己的主观成见而以外物为法则。意思是，认识事物时要尊重事物的本来情况，力求客观。因，顺应，指不强为，而是依据客观情势，顺应人情、自然等。《管子·心术上》：“无为之道，因也。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10195-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"齐诗：西汉初年传授《诗》的有鲁、齐、韩、毛四家。其中齐诗为汉初齐人辕固所传。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10195-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"务正学以言，无曲学以阿（ē）世：一定要端正学风（指谨守儒家正学）来说话，不要歪曲学术（指曲解经典的原义）来迎合世俗。阿世，迎合世俗。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10195-5"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"“修辞立其诚”，是《易传·文言》","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-10195-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的一句话。这句话虽然是两千年以前讲的，现在仍应加以肯定，仍应承认这是发言著论写文章的一个原则。“立其诚”即是坚持真实性。诚者，实也，真也。现代所谓真，古代儒家谓之为“诚”。（在中国哲学史上，首先用“真”字的是道家。《庄子》说：“道恶乎隐而有真伪","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-10195-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":" ？”以真伪对举，始于庄子。）","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"“立其诚”可以说包括三层含义：一是名实一致，二是言行一致，三是表里一致。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"名实一致即是言辞或命题与客观实际的一致。一般言辞的内容包括许多命题。哲学命题与科学命题都是表示客观事实或客观规律的。哲学命题与科学命题都可称为理论命题，理论命题符合于客观实际，就是真理的揭示。文学不是表示客观事实或客观规律的，然而也必须对于事物现象的本质有所显示，才能够感动人心。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"言行一致亦即理论与实践一致，思想与行动一致。浅言之，即一个人的言论与他的行为一致；深言之，即学说理论与社会实践一致。古语说“听其言而观其行”，听一个人的言论还要看他的行为是否符合他的言论。实践是检验真理的标准。与社会实践相符合的，才能称为真理。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"表里一致即心口一致，口中所说的与心中所想的应该一致。如果口说的是一套，心里所想的却是另一套，是谓说假话，是最明显的不诚。“修辞立其诚”，首先要表达自己的真实思想。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学说、言论、文章，都有一个诚伪问题。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"哲学与科学的目的在于追求真理，追求对于世界的正确认识。人在观察现象的时候，往往表现一定的主体性，在认识中含有一定的主观因素。但是，追求真理就应力求避免主观的干扰。《管子》书的《心术上》提出所谓“静因之道”。《心术上》说：“因也者，无益无损也。……因也者，舍己而以物为法者也","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-10195-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。”这是说，在认识外物的时候不要对于外物有所损益，力求认识外物的本来面目。列宁论“辩证法的要素”，举出十六条，第一条是“观察的客观性”，这是唯物主义方法的基本原则。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"世界，才能有效地改造世界。有时在改造世界的过程中也能加深对于世界的认识，但是对于世界的正确认识还是改造世界的基本条件。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"“修辞立其诚”，包含端正学风的问题。据《汉书·儒林传》记载，齐诗","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-10195-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的经师辕固曾对公孙弘说：“务正学以言，无曲学以阿世","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-10195-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。”所谓曲学阿世即是哗众取宠，曲解经典的原义以讨好于时尚，也就是背离了原则而顺风转舵，这就违反了追求真理的学术宗旨。“修辞立其诚”应是端正学风的首要准则。汉代经师所尊崇的是儒家的原则，我们今天则应强调社会主义的基本原则。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"揭示客观真理确非容易，但是表达自己的真实思想应该并非难事。然而，千百年来，由于世事的错综纷繁，说真话、讲实话，却不是容易做到的。人们常常把真实的思想感情隐藏起来。这是复杂的不正常的社会关系所造成的人心的扭曲。然而，把自己的真实见解表达出来，这应是“修辞立其诚”的起码要求。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"应该承认，“修辞立其诚”是一个唯物主义的原则。唯物主义肯定事实，肯定客观真理。唯物主义者无所畏惧，敢于把自己的思想见解亮出来。虽然在今天的世界上唯心主义比较流行，我还是相信，唯物主义是科学研究的真实基础。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"1992 年4 月10 日","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7jvPCpfvYLGdAkhjw5iGHKNlUM1.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7jvPCpfvYLGdAkhjw5iGHKNlUM1.pdf","text":"19920509.pdf","type":"link"},{"text":" (3.3 MB)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《张岱年全集》第八卷（河北人民出版社1996年版）。\n\n张岱年（1909—2004），河北献县人，哲学家。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7jvPCpfvYLGdAkhjw5iGHKNlUM1.pdf","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7jvPCpfvYLGdAkhjw5iGHKNlUM1.pdf","text":"19920509.pdf","title":null},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/xbz001/xbz006","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/xbz001/xbz006","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/xbz001/xbz006","title":null}],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10195,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10195-1","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10195-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10195-2","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10195-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10195-3","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10195-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10195-4","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10195-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10195-5","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10195-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7jvPCpfvYLGdAkhjw5iGHKNlUM1.pdf","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7jvPCpfvYLGdAkhjw5iGHKNlUM1.pdf","text":"19920509.pdf","title":null},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/xbz001/xbz006","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/xbz001/xbz006","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/xbz001/xbz006","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-10195-1","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-10195-1","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-10195-2","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-10195-2","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-10195-3","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-10195-3","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-10195-4","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-10195-4","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-10195-5","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-10195-5","text":"↩︎","title":null}],"media":[],"posts":[{"cookedSha256":"74475e73a56e5b16db63f4c6083d0964f52c9b8c901c51d0e98d534ddf15551d","createdAt":"2024-08-09T06:03:12Z","plainTextSha256":"ed4c58e6663653e471cae5b1458196864cd1dcaae48930f348b774b319a6da89","postId":10195,"postNumber":1,"replyToPostNumber":null,"role":"primary","updatedAt":"2025-02-15T04:10:22Z"}],"roleAuditDecisions":[],"sourceLessonPath":"data/lessons/lesson-1521.json","sourceLessonUpdatedAt":"2025-02-15T04:10:23Z","sourcePostCount":1},"resources":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/7jvPCpfvYLGdAkhjw5iGHKNlUM1.p